Changes made by READY.:
- SKILL.md: the `scripts/validate.py` invocation is replaced by the findings
  returned inline by `okf_write` plus `okf_query validate`; files are written
  with the `okf_write` tool instead of by hand.
- Rule 3 (record authorship): replaced — the tool stamps `generated` itself
  (`ready/<version>`, the time, and the attempting model in `x-ready-model`).
- Rule 4 (verification): DIVERGES from upstream — the model never records a
  verification; a person confirms content with the `/verify` session command,
  which the daemon records.
- Step 5.5 (keep `generated` for format-only changes): removed — every change
  of any value re-stamps `generated`.
- Step 5.10 (move or rename keeps `generated`/`verified`): replaced by
  create + deprecate, after which the new concept needs a new verification.
- Step 7 (index and log files): replaced — the tool maintains `index.md` and
  `log.md`; the model never edits them.
- The update section is rewritten around `base_digest` and the trust receipt.
- references/ is unchanged. scripts/ is not shipped: validation is native.
